/*
  VehicleHeroCardWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0107 · VehicleHeroCardWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `VehicleHeroCardWidget` resolves (table "VehicleHeroCardWidget") lives here with its
  web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog (parallel-unsafe across the concurrent slots).

  The first block is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/VehicleHeroCardWidget.tsx + registry/vehicle.ts). The
  status labels mirror types/fsm/vehicle.ts VEHICLE_STATE_LABELS (the web StatusBadge
  shows the capitalized state). The remaining keys back the native-only chrome
  (freshness chip, retry/empty/error copy, connectivity banners, accessibility).
*/

